WEBVTT

01:29.480 --> 01:34.430
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.890 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 3]

02:15.920 --> 02:16.750
Is it pretty?

02:24.360 --> 02:25.490
It really is pretty.

02:27.520 --> 02:29.450
You did a good job on this fish tank.

02:29.960 --> 02:31.090
This is your reward.

02:39.390 --> 02:40.150
Seriously.

02:41.350 --> 02:42.950
Why do you keep looking at me?

02:52.280 --> 02:53.280
I think you are quite different

02:53.280 --> 02:54.480
from what I imagined.

02:56.410 --> 02:57.610
What did you imagine?

03:04.780 --> 03:06.620
I thought you were

03:06.870 --> 03:07.870
the kind of rich boy who was so lazy

03:07.870 --> 03:09.590
that you just basked in the sun every day,

03:09.590 --> 03:10.400
and you didn't need to study,

03:10.400 --> 03:11.400
or think about the future.

03:11.400 --> 03:12.710
Someone would cook your meals anyway

03:12.710 --> 03:13.840
and spoon-feed you.

03:13.970 --> 03:16.110
Then, you would inherit

03:16.460 --> 03:18.360
the family business when you grew up,

03:18.360 --> 03:19.360
and hire a dozen secretaries,

03:19.360 --> 03:20.960
pretending to be

03:21.720 --> 03:23.050
a successful young man.

03:25.490 --> 03:27.290
That's exactly what I plan to do.

03:30.950 --> 03:32.410
But you don't look like it.

03:40.940 --> 03:42.940
It's the first time someone said so.

03:54.710 --> 03:56.270
You are a nice man.

03:57.130 --> 03:58.390
You won't hurt others.

03:59.570 --> 04:01.030
You are different from me.

04:04.680 --> 04:05.900
Then, tell me,

04:06.810 --> 04:08.070
who have you hurt?

04:19.170 --> 04:19.800
How did you know

04:19.800 --> 04:20.800
I was at this pool?

04:25.460 --> 04:26.310
Your secrecy

04:26.310 --> 04:27.390
was not bad.

04:29.710 --> 04:31.910
But your profile picture betrayed you.

04:33.120 --> 04:34.700
That tree has albinism.

04:35.310 --> 04:36.770
Not many people can see it.

04:38.100 --> 04:39.220
If you can see it,

04:39.270 --> 04:40.190
take a picture of it,

04:40.190 --> 04:42.120
and use it as your profile picture,

04:42.420 --> 04:44.480
it means you were in a place

04:44.610 --> 04:46.360
where you could often see it.

05:06.610 --> 05:07.560
I thought no one would

05:07.560 --> 05:08.680
notice this tree.

05:10.090 --> 05:11.490
I actually quite like it.

05:12.840 --> 05:14.040
It looks very special

05:14.300 --> 05:15.500
and quite different.

05:20.080 --> 05:21.190
People thought it was not pretty enough,

05:21.190 --> 05:21.830
so they moved it

05:21.830 --> 05:22.870
to this corner.

05:23.740 --> 05:25.100
And yet you like it.

05:31.850 --> 05:32.950
But now two people

05:32.950 --> 05:33.800
have seen it,

05:35.100 --> 05:36.580
noticed it, and

05:38.950 --> 05:40.159
both quite like it.

05:41.490 --> 05:43.220
It means the tree is not lonely.

05:43.920 --> 05:44.680
Right?

06:04.230 --> 06:05.880
♪ If you had ever seen the fireflies ♪

06:07.590 --> 06:09.050
♪ Inside my eyes ♪

06:12.350 --> 06:13.920
♪ I think you would understand ♪

06:15.630 --> 06:17.750
♪ Why I embrace the dark ♪

06:20.410 --> 06:22.190
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

06:23.650 --> 06:25.960
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

06:27.410 --> 06:29.840
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

06:31.370 --> 06:35.700
♪ Our paths suddenly overlap ♪

06:38.280 --> 06:39.659
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

06:40.430 --> 06:41.790
♪ No time left, so I ♪

06:42.690 --> 06:44.430
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

06:46.670 --> 06:49.010
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

06:49.140 --> 06:52.640
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

06:54.690 --> 06:56.909
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

06:56.970 --> 07:00.770
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

07:02.560 --> 07:03.790
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

07:03.820 --> 07:06.600
♪ This mud all over me ♪

07:07.510 --> 07:10.350
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

07:30.410 --> 07:31.960
♪ I can't remember and can't go back ♪

07:32.070 --> 07:34.020
♪ If you can't hold it tightly, let me ♪

07:34.140 --> 07:36.510
♪ Fly without hesitation ♪

07:38.400 --> 07:41.080
♪ Sorry, I'm too capricious and obsessed ♪

07:41.200 --> 07:44.470
♪ The Milky Way is drowning ♪

07:46.370 --> 07:48.970
♪ If one day you fall into ♪

07:49.100 --> 07:52.960
♪ The gap a light-year away ♪

07:56.409 --> 07:57.920
♪ You'll find ♪

07:58.030 --> 08:00.240
♪ The scattered ashes ♪

08:01.580 --> 08:06.120
♪ Burns my heart ♪

08:04.380 --> 08:07.800
[Big Ocean Motorcycle Workshop]

08:04.720 --> 08:06.430
Friendship.

08:07.540 --> 08:11.290
A friend in need is a friend indeed.

08:12.250 --> 08:15.080
I treasure the friendship in adversity...

08:15.110 --> 08:17.290
Stop reciting it. Come play for a while.

08:17.290 --> 08:17.850
No.

08:18.550 --> 08:19.500
It's no fun playing by myself.

08:19.500 --> 08:20.810
-Let’s play.
-No.

08:21.070 --> 08:22.040
I told you I'm going abroad.

08:22.040 --> 08:23.410
Did you think I was joking?

08:23.410 --> 08:24.390
After you go abroad,

08:24.390 --> 08:25.800
we'll have fewer chances
to see each other.

08:25.800 --> 08:27.200
Hang out with me for a bit.

08:28.240 --> 08:29.800
Brother.

08:30.750 --> 08:32.360
Brother.

08:32.360 --> 08:33.220
Let go of me.

08:33.440 --> 08:34.320
That's disgusting.

08:34.320 --> 08:35.590
Are you a motorcycle or something?

08:35.590 --> 08:36.960
Why so fierce?

08:38.049 --> 08:39.909
Don't tell anyone about me going abroad.

08:39.909 --> 08:40.630
I don't want my family
and all the people in the school

08:40.630 --> 08:41.480
to know about this.

08:41.480 --> 08:42.150
I see.

08:43.260 --> 08:44.480
You never invite me to the good stuff.

08:44.480 --> 08:45.410
Suit yourself.

08:46.880 --> 08:49.640
I treasure the friendship in adversity.

08:51.440 --> 08:52.730
I treasure

08:53.440 --> 08:54.390
the friendship

08:55.610 --> 08:56.730
in adversity.

09:09.700 --> 09:11.450
Is today the last day?

09:12.050 --> 09:13.050
Yes, the last day.

09:21.630 --> 09:23.040
I want to buy them,

09:23.970 --> 09:25.630
but I don't have enough money.

09:27.010 --> 09:27.640
Yu,

09:28.770 --> 09:30.170
I'll take all these fish.

09:31.110 --> 09:32.080
Where will you keep them?

09:32.080 --> 09:33.120
None of your business.

09:33.120 --> 09:33.670
Find me

09:33.670 --> 09:34.790
a bigger tank.

09:36.210 --> 09:37.400
I'll buy a tank too.

09:37.430 --> 09:38.160
Okay?

09:38.430 --> 09:39.590
Okay, no problem.

09:40.150 --> 09:42.320
You... you bought them all?

09:51.150 --> 09:52.240
I'm rich.

09:52.560 --> 09:54.300
I'll treat you to sashimi some day.

09:54.300 --> 09:55.410
Hurry up, Yu.

10:08.030 --> 10:10.090
Look at that one swimming so far away.

10:13.520 --> 10:15.160
How is it? It's sea.

10:21.890 --> 10:23.220
What are you smiling at?

10:25.440 --> 10:26.370
I'm not smiling.

10:26.800 --> 10:27.850
You did.

10:28.250 --> 10:28.970
I didn't.

10:34.270 --> 10:35.510
I actually quite like

10:37.520 --> 10:38.710
this sea.

10:47.240 --> 10:48.080
Looking at this sea,

10:48.080 --> 10:49.680
what song comes to your mind?

10:51.930 --> 10:52.600
A song?

10:57.740 --> 10:58.780
I thought of one.

10:59.450 --> 11:00.210
Which one?

11:01.450 --> 11:02.310
What about you?

11:03.470 --> 11:04.830
I asked you first.

11:05.750 --> 11:07.810
If you don't tell me, I won't tell you.

11:22.990 --> 11:23.950
Why did you put the betta fish

11:23.950 --> 11:25.080
in the pool too?

11:27.600 --> 11:28.650
Are you stupid?

11:45.240 --> 11:50.810
♪ The narcissus rides a carp,
drifting away in sadness ♪

11:52.350 --> 11:57.900
♪ Deep green lurks beneath the sea,
stirring the nebula ♪

11:59.480 --> 12:05.450
♪ On countless nights, we move forward ♪

12:06.500 --> 12:09.140
♪ Seeking, waking up and collecting ♪

12:10.380 --> 12:12.480
♪ Crazy love ♪

12:13.560 --> 12:17.990
♪ Say yes, let's start fresh ♪

12:20.740 --> 12:23.090
♪ The first night, my sunset ♪

12:23.940 --> 12:26.870
♪ The whole world, the two of us♪

12:27.530 --> 12:30.650
♪ The city doesn't sleep, ups and downs ♪

12:31.240 --> 12:34.460
♪ Breathing at midnight ♪

12:35.390 --> 12:37.760
♪ Someone lights the fire ♪

12:38.640 --> 12:41.980
♪ The love burns each other ♪

12:42.090 --> 12:45.010
♪ My organs ♪

12:45.160 --> 12:48.520
♪ Every midnight ♪

12:48.700 --> 12:51.920
♪ Being played ♪

13:09.370 --> 13:10.570
Little betta babies,

13:10.680 --> 13:12.390
let me get you a new home, okay?

13:13.770 --> 13:15.410
Why separate them?

13:15.650 --> 13:17.050
Betta fish will fight
if they are kept together.

13:17.050 --> 13:17.770
Didn't you watch

13:17.770 --> 13:19.830
"Animal World" when you were little?

13:20.010 --> 13:20.650
I didn't watch

13:20.650 --> 13:21.530
much TV as a kid.

13:23.010 --> 13:24.940
My family thought it was too noisy.

13:27.840 --> 13:28.560
It's okay.

13:28.680 --> 13:30.010
Anyway, now you know.

13:30.410 --> 13:32.870
Just don't keep them together
in the future.

13:39.530 --> 13:40.530
I just found this.

13:40.710 --> 13:41.710
Change into this.

13:41.890 --> 13:42.950
Don't catch a cold.

13:48.680 --> 13:50.210
You'd change too.

13:56.830 --> 13:58.140
You can change inside.

14:52.560 --> 14:54.620
Why do you want to go abroad secretly?

14:59.860 --> 15:02.320
Because there's no one here
I'm attached to.

15:07.600 --> 15:08.820
And then?

15:10.170 --> 15:11.430
Where do you want to go?

15:12.440 --> 15:14.240
As long as I can study what I want,

15:14.250 --> 15:15.250
anywhere is fine.

15:17.440 --> 15:18.890
If you have a choice,

15:19.530 --> 15:21.060
it's better to be cautious.

15:22.370 --> 15:23.650
You are smart.

15:27.650 --> 15:30.110
What about you?
Where are you planning to go?

15:33.880 --> 15:34.690
I don't know.

15:35.680 --> 15:37.210
I haven't thought about it.

15:40.130 --> 15:41.930
I don't have that kind of luxury.

15:45.200 --> 15:46.200
You should be more cautious.

15:46.200 --> 15:47.400
That would be better.

15:47.410 --> 15:48.650
You are good at stuyding.

15:48.650 --> 15:49.200
You're not like me,

15:49.200 --> 15:50.560
someone

15:50.680 --> 15:52.610
who has a very laid-back attitude.

15:58.410 --> 15:59.610
Maybe we are the same.

16:01.320 --> 16:02.010
What?

16:04.080 --> 16:05.440
We're both only 18.

16:06.130 --> 16:07.660
We don't have any solutions

16:08.360 --> 16:09.760
or any choices.

16:17.800 --> 16:19.340
This seems to be

16:19.370 --> 16:21.010
a club's T-shirt.

16:46.250 --> 16:49.380
Are you coming on the day of
the parent-teacher meeting?

16:49.440 --> 16:51.680
I heard there's a club festival that day.

16:51.680 --> 16:54.100
People will release balloons together.

16:54.290 --> 16:56.020
They say it'll be quite lively.

16:57.680 --> 16:58.440
No.

16:59.010 --> 17:00.210
I don't have parents.

17:01.370 --> 17:02.050
Besides,

17:02.720 --> 17:03.930
writing wishes on balloons

17:03.930 --> 17:04.680
sounds

17:05.480 --> 17:06.520
boring.

17:07.810 --> 17:09.829
Balloons won't fly up to the sky

17:10.040 --> 17:12.089
and bless us with good grades
in the college entrance examination.

17:12.089 --> 17:13.609
They will only get caught in the trees

17:13.609 --> 17:14.670
and then fall down.

17:26.480 --> 17:27.810
What if I say

17:30.680 --> 17:32.680
I want to release balloons with you?

17:40.610 --> 17:42.940
Actually, I have something to ask you too.

17:44.170 --> 17:45.390
It feels like

17:45.410 --> 17:47.210
you're trying to get close to me.

17:52.330 --> 17:53.130
Why?

18:00.160 --> 18:01.560
Which class are you from?

18:01.890 --> 18:02.950
What are you doing?

18:04.370 --> 18:06.810
What are you doing here
in the middle of the night?

18:06.810 --> 18:07.480
Come out!

18:19.480 --> 18:20.650
Attention, guys.

18:21.090 --> 18:22.240
Attention!

18:23.090 --> 18:23.810
Yesterday,

18:24.000 --> 18:25.550
an incident occurred in our school

18:25.550 --> 18:27.100
that requires serious criticism

18:25.670 --> 18:27.190
[Teacher's Office]

18:27.130 --> 18:29.050
and a thorough self-reflection.

18:27.970 --> 18:30.250
[Teacher's Office]

18:30.370 --> 18:31.640
Two students,

18:32.000 --> 18:34.760
Lu Xixiao from Class 7, Grade 12,

18:35.130 --> 18:37.810
and Zhou Wan from Class 1, Grade 12.

18:38.330 --> 18:39.200
stole

18:39.200 --> 18:40.930
lab equipments

18:41.010 --> 18:43.200
and kept goldfish in the swimming pool.

18:42.810 --> 18:45.860
[Work hard and live up to
youth and yourself]

18:43.410 --> 18:45.680
This is a serious violation of
school rules.

18:45.680 --> 18:47.040
After discussion, we've decided

18:47.040 --> 18:49.640
that they must make
a public self-reflection.

18:49.650 --> 18:50.370
Of course,

18:50.650 --> 18:51.930
with such an incident occurring,

18:51.930 --> 18:53.410
we teachers also bear some responsibility,

18:53.410 --> 18:54.280
and also need to self-ref...

18:54.280 --> 18:56.480
-Don’t blame yourself.
-As the saying goes...

18:56.480 --> 18:57.520
It's my fault.

18:58.610 --> 18:59.610
Hello, everyone.

18:59.650 --> 19:02.650
I'm Lu Xixiao from Class 7, Grade 12.

19:02.760 --> 19:04.110
This is Lu Xixiao.

19:04.440 --> 19:05.970
Make a serious reflection.

19:07.170 --> 19:08.040
Yesterday,

19:08.280 --> 19:10.270
I not only sneaked into the school

19:10.650 --> 19:12.310
and misused public property,

19:13.410 --> 19:15.650
but also under the guise
of doing an experiment,

19:15.650 --> 19:18.130
I incited Zhou Wan from Class 1

19:18.240 --> 19:19.130
to join me.

19:23.000 --> 19:24.950
Now I feel incredibly ashamed.

19:26.410 --> 19:27.280
I feel

19:27.890 --> 19:29.350
I have let down the school,

19:29.810 --> 19:31.050
and my teachers.

19:32.810 --> 19:34.410
And the one I let down the most

19:36.240 --> 19:37.520
is Zhou Wan.

19:39.890 --> 19:41.490
Zhou Wan is quite something.

19:42.650 --> 19:43.920
I've never seen him

19:43.990 --> 19:45.090
so willingly

19:45.090 --> 19:46.410
take the blame for anyone.

19:46.410 --> 19:47.930
Isn't that obvious?

19:48.410 --> 19:49.000
Zhou Wan

19:49.000 --> 19:50.530
would never do such a thing.

19:50.760 --> 19:52.650
It's all your fault for dragging her down.

19:52.650 --> 19:53.930
What's that got to do with me?

19:53.930 --> 19:54.760
It's your fault.

19:54.760 --> 19:56.810
I wasn't even there that day, okay?

20:01.720 --> 20:03.650
I'm Zhou Wan from Class 1, Grade 12.

20:04.760 --> 20:06.890
I'm sorry for letting down my teachers

20:06.930 --> 20:08.680
and my classmates.

20:09.240 --> 20:10.970
I will deeply reflect on myself

20:11.000 --> 20:12.930
and promise it won't happen again.

20:16.760 --> 20:18.220
I hope all students

20:18.280 --> 20:19.830
will take this as a warning,

20:20.570 --> 20:21.970
especially

20:22.090 --> 20:22.960
those boys

20:22.980 --> 20:23.810
who love showing off.

20:23.810 --> 20:25.040
Behave yourselves.

20:25.520 --> 20:27.520
I'm always watching you.

20:28.760 --> 20:29.940
I'll say it again.

20:30.090 --> 20:31.330
Students of Grade 12,

20:31.440 --> 20:33.720
you don't have much time left.

20:35.490 --> 20:36.290
You can leave.

20:36.330 --> 20:37.260
Go back to class.

20:37.290 --> 20:40.080
[Teacher's Office]

20:40.930 --> 20:41.790
Thank you, sir.

20:45.000 --> 20:45.760
Lu Xixiao.

20:51.610 --> 20:56.300
[Teacher's Office]

20:51.930 --> 20:52.650
Well.

20:53.940 --> 20:54.760
Is this your

20:54.760 --> 20:56.560
first public self-reflection?

20:57.890 --> 20:59.330
We did this together.

20:59.520 --> 21:00.370
You don't have to take

21:00.370 --> 21:01.720
all the blame yourself.

21:02.810 --> 21:04.240
How could this affect me?

21:04.240 --> 21:06.240
I'm leaving sooner or later anyway.

21:06.440 --> 21:07.170
But you are

21:07.720 --> 21:09.220
graduating soon.

21:09.520 --> 21:10.570
You don't want
anything to go wrong

21:10.570 --> 21:12.900
before the college entrance exam, right?

21:16.520 --> 21:17.650
I don't owe favors.

21:17.630 --> 21:21.230
[Teacher's Office]

21:18.200 --> 21:19.800
I'll treat you after school.

21:22.240 --> 21:22.930
Okay.

21:38.270 --> 21:41.250
[Excellent Writing Exhibition]

21:44.930 --> 21:47.860
♪ I will keep this frozen heart ♪

21:49.310 --> 21:51.130
♪ I think someone will accept it ♪

21:51.240 --> 21:54.070
♪ In my broken heart ♪

21:53.470 --> 21:58.740
[Excellent Writing Exhibition]

21:55.670 --> 21:57.540
[will be repaired.]

21:58.640 --> 22:02.350
♪ It's just that I'm unforgivable ♪

21:59.410 --> 22:00.610
Take it. Let's go

22:02.680 --> 22:06.260
♪ Self-reflection in your heart ♪

22:04.410 --> 22:06.290
Do you want to go back
together with me later?

22:06.290 --> 22:07.530
I'll go back later.

22:08.520 --> 22:09.820
♪ Being ignorant doesn't mean ♪

22:09.850 --> 22:11.050
♪ I can do whatever I want ♪

22:09.960 --> 22:13.410
[16 days countdown of
college entrance exam]

22:12.000 --> 22:12.810
Give it back.

22:14.220 --> 22:16.100
♪ I seem to have never ♪

22:16.170 --> 22:18.550
♪ Closed the sunroof ♪

22:19.280 --> 22:20.170
Wan.

22:21.300 --> 22:23.750
♪ Let me tell you the stars
are shining on the rooftop ♪

22:21.950 --> 22:23.280
Where's Wan, Jiang Yan?

22:24.240 --> 22:25.130
Are you deaf?

22:26.000 --> 22:27.000
Wan.

22:31.370 --> 22:32.530
Why aren't we there yet?

22:32.530 --> 22:33.570
I'm exhausted.

22:34.520 --> 22:35.960
You complained that the bike

22:35.960 --> 22:36.650
was too slow,

22:36.650 --> 22:38.290
so I took you on a shortcut.

22:38.410 --> 22:39.810
-You’re complaining that you're tired now?
-Didn’t I let you

22:39.810 --> 22:40.850
sit on the back of my bike?

22:40.850 --> 22:42.410
It would have taken only five minutes
to get here.

22:42.410 --> 22:44.270
I won't sit on anyone's backseat.

22:45.000 --> 22:46.570
Do you know how many people

22:46.420 --> 22:52.150
[Ms. Zheng's Fast food]

22:46.570 --> 22:48.060
want to sit on my backseat?

22:48.520 --> 22:49.920
Then, let them sit there.

22:50.610 --> 22:51.440
Uncle Kang.

22:51.850 --> 22:52.460
Wan.

22:54.370 --> 22:55.240
I've set it up. Come on.

22:55.240 --> 22:55.960
I'll make you noodles.

22:55.960 --> 22:57.760
I have a classmate with me today.

23:01.090 --> 23:02.090
Nice motorcycle.

23:03.410 --> 23:04.190
Really?

23:05.000 --> 23:06.130
You know your stuff.

23:07.650 --> 23:08.480
Well, he has a nice motorcycle.

23:08.480 --> 23:09.760
Why didn't you sit on the backseat?

23:09.760 --> 23:11.680
-Why are you pushing this?
-I wish everyone could be

23:11.680 --> 23:12.520
like you.

23:14.030 --> 23:15.560
Can I touch it? Come on.

23:15.590 --> 23:16.500
-Uncle Kang.
-Nothing.

23:15.650 --> 23:20.780
[Uncle Kang's Noodle Shop]

23:16.520 --> 23:17.650
Wait, wait a minute.

23:19.000 --> 23:20.090
When I was young,

23:20.120 --> 23:21.010
I loved riding motorcycles.

23:21.010 --> 23:22.100
I rode

23:22.170 --> 23:23.240
Xingfu 250.

23:23.280 --> 23:24.010
It was so cool

23:24.890 --> 23:25.610
to ride it.

23:26.000 --> 23:27.130
I don't think you've ever seen
that motorcycle.

23:27.130 --> 23:28.680
My friend runs a dealership.

23:28.680 --> 23:29.990
You should come to visit with me sometime.

23:29.990 --> 23:30.760
Forget it.

23:30.760 --> 23:32.020
I'm too old for that.

23:35.480 --> 23:36.410
Your boyfriend?

23:36.520 --> 23:37.280
Classmate.

23:37.890 --> 23:39.240
You're in love.

23:39.280 --> 23:40.960
-Fen. Fen.
-I know Grandma is not here.

23:40.960 --> 23:42.130
Don't try to scare me.

23:42.130 --> 23:43.790
I was just trying to scare you.

23:44.130 --> 23:45.280
Let's go. Come on in.

23:46.040 --> 23:46.570
Hurry.

23:51.830 --> 23:53.620
[Uncle Kang's Noodle Shop]

24:03.330 --> 24:06.550
[Handmade noodles]

24:08.440 --> 24:09.130
What?

24:09.810 --> 24:12.410
Haven't you ever been to
a small shop like this?

24:13.160 --> 24:14.800
No.

24:16.370 --> 24:18.370
I want to eat everything on the menu.

24:22.240 --> 24:23.700
What do you usually order?

24:23.890 --> 24:24.760
You don't need to.

24:24.760 --> 24:26.520
I already ordered for you. The special.

24:26.520 --> 24:27.250
The special?

24:28.510 --> 24:29.310
What special?

24:29.720 --> 24:32.120
Something you won't be disappointed with.

24:41.280 --> 24:42.610
For the class I owed you last time,

24:42.610 --> 24:44.340
I'll make it up to you next time.

24:44.810 --> 24:47.740
I have to go to
the parent-teacher meeting tomorrow.

24:48.890 --> 24:49.410
Okay.

24:50.020 --> 24:53.270
[Handmade noodles]

24:57.610 --> 24:58.170
How is it?

24:59.170 --> 25:00.580
I had it custom-made.

25:00.760 --> 25:02.090
It will arrive tonight.

25:02.280 --> 25:03.360
It's so big.

25:06.240 --> 25:07.650
So big?

25:08.000 --> 25:10.000
Three delicacies noodles special.

25:10.760 --> 25:11.530
Is it okay?

25:11.570 --> 25:12.850
Eat slowly, don't burn yourself.

25:12.850 --> 25:13.520
Thank you.

25:16.520 --> 25:17.000
This...

25:29.520 --> 25:30.280
Is it good?

25:32.680 --> 25:34.230
My grandma works here.

25:34.410 --> 25:35.760
This is my personal recipe.

25:35.760 --> 25:37.490
You can't get it anywhere else.

25:37.650 --> 25:39.380
Your grandma still works here?

25:41.130 --> 25:43.260
It's a good thing she's not here today.

25:43.760 --> 25:44.560
Here, drinks.

25:45.410 --> 25:46.170
Thank you, Uncle Kang.

25:46.170 --> 25:47.570
No need to thank me. Here.

25:49.280 --> 25:50.960
Wan, I'm going to school tomorrow too

25:50.960 --> 25:52.280
for my granddaughter's
parent-teacher meeting.

25:52.280 --> 25:54.210
Want me to give your grandma a ride?

25:55.480 --> 25:57.540
She hasn't been feeling well lately.

25:57.760 --> 25:58.760
The parent-teacher meeting isn't

25:58.760 --> 26:00.360
a particularly grand event.

26:00.410 --> 26:01.470
I won't bother her.

26:02.720 --> 26:03.520
All right.

26:05.090 --> 26:05.760
By the way,

26:06.410 --> 26:08.540
what's the displacement of that bike?

26:10.810 --> 26:11.650
650.

26:31.650 --> 26:32.890
I'll help you pick them.

26:32.890 --> 26:33.520
No worries.

26:33.520 --> 26:34.470
Let me help you.

26:34.810 --> 26:35.410
It's okay.

26:41.930 --> 26:43.520
Do you have any more vegetables?

26:43.520 --> 26:44.520
Why is there so little left?

26:44.520 --> 26:46.250
-Okay.
-I'll take some for you.

26:59.260 --> 27:01.360
Grandma, I'm back.

27:02.810 --> 27:04.240
You haven't eaten yet?

27:04.760 --> 27:05.650
Have you eaten?

27:06.520 --> 27:07.480
I did.

27:09.410 --> 27:11.070
You ate noodles as well today?

27:11.650 --> 27:12.850
You had one bowl of noodles

27:12.850 --> 27:14.150
but paid for two.

27:15.520 --> 27:17.050
What are you talking about?

27:18.410 --> 27:19.370
With a boy?

27:21.520 --> 27:22.850
He is just my classmate.

27:26.000 --> 27:27.810
You haven't eaten your noodles yet.

27:27.810 --> 27:29.430
Eat less carbs

27:30.000 --> 27:30.930
but more shrimp.

27:31.520 --> 27:32.370
Oh no.

27:33.650 --> 27:35.410
Jiang Yan was right.

27:36.000 --> 27:37.460
You're hiding something.

27:37.610 --> 27:39.890
So whenever you want to lie,

27:39.890 --> 27:42.130
you will change the subject.

27:43.840 --> 27:45.100
What did Jiang Yan say?

27:45.130 --> 27:46.460
He didn't say anything.

27:46.610 --> 27:47.760
I asked him.

27:48.280 --> 27:49.410
I wouldn't have known if I hadn't asked.

27:49.410 --> 27:51.000
I was shocked.

27:51.170 --> 27:53.240
You've given up on entering
Huaqing University.

27:53.240 --> 27:54.170
What's more, you skipped classes,

27:54.170 --> 27:55.650
and got reported and criticised.

27:55.650 --> 27:57.410
Are you trying to make me mad?

28:00.480 --> 28:01.720
It's not that serious.

28:01.720 --> 28:02.810
Not that serious?

28:15.650 --> 28:16.410
I haven't wanted to

28:16.410 --> 28:18.540
go to school out of town for a long time.

28:19.800 --> 28:21.730
What's so good about other places?

28:22.410 --> 28:23.890
I will feel lonely

28:24.020 --> 28:26.240
if I go to school
in another city by myself.

28:26.240 --> 28:27.570
I wouldn't be used to it.

28:28.520 --> 28:29.960
Getting into Huaqing University

28:29.960 --> 28:31.490
isn't that important to me.

28:36.810 --> 28:37.520
Wan.

28:39.520 --> 28:40.650
You are grown up now,

28:41.520 --> 28:43.370
and you have a lot of ideas.

28:44.610 --> 28:45.930
Your destiny is in

28:45.930 --> 28:47.200
your own hands.

28:48.240 --> 28:49.650
I won't interfere.

28:50.810 --> 28:52.240
But remember,

28:53.280 --> 28:54.930
all I hope for is

28:55.610 --> 28:57.270
that you can be safe and sound,

28:57.520 --> 29:00.000
healthy, and happy.

29:32.810 --> 29:34.740
You've even learned how to snitch.

29:35.130 --> 29:35.650
I...

29:36.280 --> 29:36.810
I was just

29:36.910 --> 29:38.650
afraid that
you would get too close to him.

29:38.650 --> 29:39.480
Do you and Lu Xixiao

29:39.480 --> 29:40.930
have some kind of grudge?

29:43.760 --> 29:45.240
He's quite nice.

29:45.440 --> 29:46.370
And maybe

29:46.390 --> 29:47.170
you two will have a chance...

29:47.170 --> 29:48.770
There won't be such a chance.

29:56.410 --> 29:57.370
He doesn't live

29:57.370 --> 29:58.650
the same kind of life as us.

29:58.650 --> 29:59.650
-Jiang Yan.
-I...

29:59.650 --> 30:01.040
I know what I'm doing.

30:02.410 --> 30:03.410
We are friends.

30:03.810 --> 30:04.850
But there are some things

30:04.850 --> 30:06.780
that friends just can't help with.

30:10.170 --> 30:11.900
You can't tell me those things?

30:16.130 --> 30:16.930
I'm sorry.

30:22.720 --> 30:23.520
It's nothing.

30:35.370 --> 30:36.520
I just feel

30:38.000 --> 30:40.240
we've been drifting apart lately.

30:41.610 --> 30:42.280
After all,

30:44.280 --> 30:45.460
you've always been

30:46.280 --> 30:47.520
my only friend.

30:53.410 --> 30:54.130
Do you remember

30:54.130 --> 30:55.500
when we first met?

30:59.410 --> 31:00.170
Yes.

31:00.890 --> 31:01.890
At that time,

31:02.930 --> 31:04.000
I just moved here,

31:04.410 --> 31:06.210
and my mom wasn't in a good state.

31:08.000 --> 31:09.650
You were so scared back then.

31:09.890 --> 31:11.690
You kept hiding here and crying.

31:12.170 --> 31:13.170
After I found you,

31:13.170 --> 31:14.520
we got into a fight.

31:15.720 --> 31:17.940
Because you found this place first.

31:18.240 --> 31:19.370
But later I was willing

31:19.370 --> 31:20.970
to share this place with you.

31:22.240 --> 31:23.630
You are my first friend.

31:24.480 --> 31:25.480
I won't blame you.

31:26.960 --> 31:29.360
And I promise you,

31:30.200 --> 31:31.440
it will be over soon.

31:35.810 --> 31:36.680
Actually,

31:38.200 --> 31:40.090
you can still go to Huaqing University.

31:40.090 --> 31:41.620
Your grandma thinks so too.

31:41.850 --> 31:43.850
It has nothing to do with my grandma.

31:46.330 --> 31:47.730
I haven't figured out yet

31:48.000 --> 31:48.970
what kind of person

31:48.970 --> 31:49.900
I want to become.

31:51.960 --> 31:52.820
What about you?

31:53.240 --> 31:55.240
What kind of person do you want to be?

31:56.040 --> 31:57.850
Someone successful.

31:58.810 --> 31:59.440
And you?

32:02.090 --> 32:04.020
I haven't really thought about it.

32:06.680 --> 32:08.410
At least a kind person.

32:10.930 --> 32:11.850
Why?

32:12.810 --> 32:14.470
Have you not been kind lately?

32:17.200 --> 32:18.520
What do you think?

32:18.520 --> 32:19.570
You hit me again.

32:20.570 --> 32:22.370
I get mad just thinking about it.

32:23.370 --> 32:24.330
If you snitch again,

32:24.330 --> 32:25.810
I won't hang out with you anymore.

32:25.810 --> 32:26.680
I won't.

32:39.760 --> 32:40.960
The moon tonight...

32:41.090 --> 32:42.360
It's so full.

34:23.230 --> 34:26.190
[New message from Lu Xixiao]

34:30.120 --> 34:31.250
Check your Moments.

34:34.090 --> 34:34.920
[Lu Xixiao]

34:34.940 --> 34:36.230
[Moments]

34:36.360 --> 34:37.920
[Lu Xixiao]

35:01.930 --> 35:03.890
[Lu Xixiao sent a new message]

35:03.940 --> 35:06.400
[Check Moments]

35:07.410 --> 35:09.340
What time is the club festival?

35:15.600 --> 35:16.290
Zhou Wan.

35:17.000 --> 35:18.730
Are you sure you want to do this?

35:19.250 --> 35:20.380
Like a shot arrow,

35:20.480 --> 35:22.110
there's no turning back.

35:31.820 --> 35:33.660
[Check Moments]

35:32.770 --> 35:33.640
15:30.

35:41.090 --> 35:46.460
[Set up notes]

35:49.420 --> 35:50.880
[Set up notes]

35:50.910 --> 35:51.890
[Loading]

35:51.910 --> 35:52.920
[Information settings]

35:52.940 --> 35:53.590
[Bow and Arrow]

36:02.120 --> 36:02.960
Students,

36:03.640 --> 36:06.900
with the college entrance exam
approaching,

36:07.000 --> 36:08.600
I hope you can

36:07.310 --> 36:08.890
[Music Club]

36:08.690 --> 36:09.850
spare no effort,

36:10.850 --> 36:12.250
study hard,

36:12.410 --> 36:14.210
and persevere to the very end.

36:13.530 --> 36:15.210
[Hot] [Hot] [Hot]

36:16.410 --> 36:18.330
Well, excuse me, sir.

36:18.520 --> 36:19.860
I know it's today,

36:20.080 --> 36:21.600
but I hit some traffic.

36:21.810 --> 36:22.940
Has Xixiao arrived?

36:23.290 --> 36:25.750
He hasn't stayed at home
these past few days.

36:27.330 --> 36:28.640
I've already told him.

36:29.410 --> 36:30.380
That's great.

36:30.600 --> 36:31.520
I was worried that

36:31.520 --> 36:32.980
he would be upset to see me.

36:33.120 --> 36:34.250
I'll be right there.

36:34.480 --> 36:35.080
Okay.

36:35.850 --> 36:36.850
I'll wait for you.

36:37.410 --> 36:38.560
Okay, see you later.

36:43.210 --> 36:44.770
Attention, students.

36:45.120 --> 36:46.760
Attention, students.

36:47.130 --> 36:49.160
The balloon release event of

36:48.480 --> 36:49.870
[Lu Xixiao]

36:49.250 --> 36:51.250
the club festival parent-teacher meeting

36:51.250 --> 36:52.690
will start at 3:30 PM

36:52.720 --> 36:53.880
punctually.

36:53.960 --> 36:55.890
Parents and students, please

36:54.370 --> 36:57.720
[I'll wait for you at the playground]

36:56.080 --> 36:57.930
gather at the playground on time

36:58.120 --> 36:59.660
to sign in.

37:03.440 --> 37:04.480
Sorry.

37:12.580 --> 37:16.210
[National Painting Club] [Guitar Club]

37:14.480 --> 37:15.900
Okay. One more.

37:16.930 --> 37:19.040
Three, two, one.

37:19.690 --> 37:21.920
Wan, perfect.

37:22.080 --> 37:22.960
Let me introduce.

37:22.960 --> 37:24.160
-My parents.
-I'm sorry.

37:24.160 --> 37:25.120
Come here.

37:25.120 --> 37:26.560
This is my good friend, Wan.

37:26.560 --> 37:27.250
-Hello, uncle and aunt.
-Hello.

37:27.250 --> 37:28.370
-Hello.
-Hello.

37:28.730 --> 37:30.160
Can you take a picture of
me and my parents?

37:30.160 --> 37:30.690
Sure.

37:33.730 --> 37:35.360
Three, two, one.

37:37.170 --> 37:37.560
Okay.

37:37.560 --> 37:38.370
Let me see.

37:38.640 --> 37:39.330
I'll take a picture of you

37:39.330 --> 37:40.440
and your classmate.

37:40.440 --> 37:42.120
Okay, let's take a picture.

37:42.370 --> 37:43.330
Okay, come on.

37:43.810 --> 37:45.340
Good. Closer to the center.

37:45.860 --> 37:47.160
-Do I look good, Dad?
-Yes. Take a look.

37:47.160 --> 37:47.960
Very good.

37:47.960 --> 37:48.600
Let me see.

37:48.600 --> 37:50.160
-What do you think?
-Nice.

37:50.160 --> 37:51.480
-Good. Good.
-Nice.

37:52.440 --> 37:53.040
Okay.

37:53.770 --> 37:54.640
Thank you, uncle.

37:54.640 --> 37:55.540
What are you going to

37:55.540 --> 37:56.290
write on the balloon later?

37:56.290 --> 37:56.960
If you don't want to be alone,

37:56.960 --> 37:57.850
come to me.

37:58.690 --> 38:00.480
It doesn't matter what I write.

38:00.640 --> 38:02.110
It won't come true anyway.

38:02.210 --> 38:03.850
That's too realistic.

38:04.000 --> 38:05.290
Attention, guys.

38:05.640 --> 38:07.570
It's 3:00 PM now.

38:07.740 --> 38:09.660
Please hurry up and

38:09.930 --> 38:11.500
think about your dreams

38:11.730 --> 38:13.180
and your wishes.

38:13.730 --> 38:14.850
-My dream is...
-Meng.

38:14.850 --> 38:16.440
I have something to do. I have to go.

38:16.440 --> 38:17.940
Attention!

38:18.010 --> 38:20.110
[Future]

38:18.160 --> 38:20.500
It's 3:20 PM now.

38:20.680 --> 38:22.600
Our activity is about to start.

38:22.600 --> 38:23.600
Please hurry up.

38:23.600 --> 38:24.910
Hurry up.

38:25.890 --> 38:27.440
We will release the balloons

38:27.440 --> 38:28.980
on time later.

38:29.040 --> 38:29.730
I hope my precious daughter

38:29.730 --> 38:32.000
can be happy every day.

38:33.040 --> 38:34.510
Happy every day.

38:35.520 --> 38:36.940
Success in your studies.

38:37.040 --> 38:38.520
May your dreams come true.

38:39.450 --> 38:43.860
[College Entrance Exam Rally,
Let Your Dreams Fly]

38:39.520 --> 38:41.370
Students, be quiet.

38:41.600 --> 38:42.930
Head teachers and class monitors

38:42.930 --> 38:44.520
of each class,

38:44.520 --> 38:45.690
please help organize.

38:45.690 --> 38:47.750
Parents, please stay with your kids.

38:47.770 --> 38:48.930
Our balloon-releasing activity

38:48.930 --> 38:50.040
will start soon.

38:51.000 --> 38:52.660
Students, hurry up and

38:52.770 --> 38:55.040
write down your wishes and blessings.

38:55.040 --> 38:56.250
Good students also
participate in this kind of activity?

38:56.250 --> 38:57.090
Of course.

38:57.290 --> 38:58.210
on the balloons.

38:58.210 --> 38:59.210
Miss Straight-A,

38:59.210 --> 39:00.480
you also participate in this activity?

39:00.480 --> 39:01.600
Is Lu Xixiao here?

39:02.330 --> 39:04.190
No, he said he had something to do.

39:05.810 --> 39:07.470
I haven't written my wish yet.

39:14.120 --> 39:15.850
Okay, time's up.

39:16.040 --> 39:17.890
Count down with me.

39:18.350 --> 39:22.020
Three, two, one.

39:21.350 --> 39:21.970
[College Entrance Exam Rally,
Let Your Dreams Fly]

39:22.040 --> 39:25.080
May your dreams come true.

39:25.160 --> 39:27.210
May our dreams come true.

39:27.210 --> 39:28.850
May our dreams come true.

39:29.080 --> 39:31.210
May our dreams come true.

39:31.210 --> 39:32.950
May our dreams come true.

39:32.790 --> 39:38.230
[Mingde Building]

39:33.080 --> 39:35.600
May our dreams come true.

39:39.570 --> 39:43.270
♪ Should I chase freedom all alone ♪

39:44.570 --> 39:47.310
♪ Find an excuse, heed what I've known ♪

39:49.180 --> 39:51.010
♪ Every time I stop and stay ♪

39:51.030 --> 39:53.370
♪ For reasons that fade away ♪

39:54.850 --> 39:57.500
♪ After the long night ♪

39:59.200 --> 40:01.220
♪ I'll find my way, no more lost inside ♪

40:02.430 --> 40:05.470
♪ Thinking about ♪

40:07.200 --> 40:10.430
♪ Fulfilling the last promise ♪

40:12.930 --> 40:14.570
♪ We've both held fragility ♪

40:14.850 --> 40:16.180
♪ Talked through our misery ♪

40:16.650 --> 40:19.100
♪ This time
I'm holding tight to your will ♪

40:20.820 --> 40:22.400
♪ Lighting up all the sparks ♪

40:22.890 --> 40:26.490
♪ Hoping it doesn't slip away ♪

40:28.220 --> 40:29.910
♪ In this boring universe ♪

40:29.930 --> 40:31.360
♪ Drifting day by day ♪

40:31.840 --> 40:35.540
♪ Until the day I choose
to break away for you ♪

40:35.780 --> 40:37.010
♪ And that's enough to do ♪

40:38.540 --> 40:41.370
♪ Falling into your tenderness ♪

40:40.480 --> 40:41.850
You are late

40:42.410 --> 40:43.930
because you went to buy balloons?

40:43.420 --> 40:45.760
♪ Slowly being saved ♪

40:44.440 --> 40:46.330
One or two balloons are too boring.

40:46.330 --> 40:47.410
It feels much better

40:47.410 --> 40:48.370
to have so many wishes

40:48.370 --> 40:49.160
all come true at once,

40:49.160 --> 40:49.930
right?

40:55.640 --> 40:56.240
Come here.

41:13.140 --> 41:14.720
♪ We've both held fragility ♪

41:14.840 --> 41:16.270
♪ Talked through our misery ♪

41:16.710 --> 41:19.300
♪ This time
I'm holding tight to your will ♪

41:20.940 --> 41:22.610
♪ Lighting up all the sparks ♪

41:22.710 --> 41:26.140
♪ Hoping it doesn't slip away ♪

41:28.160 --> 41:29.690
♪ In this boring universe ♪

41:29.720 --> 41:31.660
♪ Drifting day by day ♪

41:31.930 --> 41:35.650
♪ Until the day I choose
to break away for you ♪

41:35.920 --> 41:37.370
♪ And that's enough to do ♪

41:36.250 --> 41:37.600
Is it a bit too greedy

41:37.850 --> 41:39.480
to make so many wishes?

41:38.420 --> 41:41.680
♪ Falling into your tenderness ♪

41:40.250 --> 41:41.600
If you are not greedy,

41:41.600 --> 41:43.420
what did you

41:43.380 --> 41:45.690
♪ Slowly being saved ♪

41:43.520 --> 41:44.560
do all this for?

41:49.850 --> 41:50.890
Though I knew that

41:50.890 --> 41:52.220
you have other motives,

41:52.600 --> 41:55.060
I am willing to help you
fulfill your wishes.

41:55.080 --> 41:56.010
Just consider it

41:57.250 --> 41:58.120
you owe me one.

42:08.120 --> 42:09.040
Xixiao.

42:14.960 --> 42:15.890
Xixiao.

42:18.890 --> 42:19.640
Lu Xixiao.

42:30.600 --> 42:31.410
Thank you.

42:42.960 --> 42:43.930
My wish

42:45.640 --> 42:46.900
has already come true.

42:54.440 --> 42:55.210
Xixiao.

42:59.250 --> 42:59.890
Xixiao.

43:01.730 --> 43:04.570
Here you go. May your dreams come true.

43:07.960 --> 43:09.840
You hasn't made a wish yet.

43:10.410 --> 43:12.140
But letting them go is good too.

43:12.440 --> 43:13.480
You really think you are my mother,

43:13.480 --> 43:14.080
don't you?

43:16.270 --> 43:17.120
Of course.

43:19.890 --> 43:21.120
Instead of wasting time here,

43:21.120 --> 43:22.330
you should think of a way

43:22.330 --> 43:24.330
to have another son for Lu Zhongyue.

43:24.690 --> 43:26.560
You are my only son.

43:31.120 --> 43:31.810
Zhou Wan.

43:33.410 --> 43:34.160
Mrs. Lu.

43:35.290 --> 43:35.960
Mrs. Lu.

43:36.330 --> 43:37.810
Hello. Welcome.

43:37.890 --> 43:38.650
Hello.

43:38.730 --> 43:40.210
What do you think of

43:40.210 --> 43:41.340
our event this time?

43:41.770 --> 43:42.960
This time it is mainly

43:42.960 --> 43:44.690
to boost the students' morale.

43:48.120 --> 43:50.180
You seem to hate that woman very much.

43:50.930 --> 43:51.960
I hate her.

43:53.590 --> 43:55.390
Does your dad like her very much?

43:56.330 --> 43:57.790
He just needs a woman

43:58.040 --> 43:59.370
who is pretty, obedient,

43:59.370 --> 44:00.890
and easy to manipulate.

44:02.040 --> 44:02.850
What if she does something

44:02.850 --> 44:04.330
your dad doesn't like?

44:12.160 --> 44:12.930
That is the original intention of

44:12.930 --> 44:14.700
our event, right?

44:17.440 --> 44:18.640
Then, he'll dump her.

44:24.950 --> 44:26.610
It is our biggest motivation.

44:56.770 --> 44:58.100
Can't you recognize me,

44:58.560 --> 44:59.080
Mom?
